      "date": "2026-05-23T04:59:09.000Z",
      "title": "Some May Be Optimistic About PDS' (NSE:PDSL) Earnings",
      "body": "PDS Limited's ( NSE:PDSL ) recent soft profit numbers didn't appear to worry shareholders, as the stock price showed...",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/stocks/in/consumer-durables/nse-pdsl/pds-shares/news/some-may-be-optimistic-about-pds-nsepdsl-earnings",
