      "title": "PDSL: International Reactivations And Margin Recovery Will Support Higher Earnings Multiple",
      "body": "Analysts have nudged the PDS price target higher to ₹545, reflecting updated assumptions around discount rates, long term revenue growth, profit margins and future P/E. These assumptions broadly align with recent Street research, where firms lifted their targets despite near term estimate pressures and mixed margin impacts.",
